        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "db21c701-8ee2-3f87-9939-b63ab2081d71",
                "word": "прощайте",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbe1133d-dcdf-38eb-8e13-b32df46445a5",
                        "entry_id": "db21c701-8ee2-3f87-9939-b63ab2081d71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. то же, что прощай; употребляется при прощании, расставании на длительное время или навсегда"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee3dcf36-7ae3-48c1-bea7-9547eedda0a6",
                                "sense_id": "dbe1133d-dcdf-38eb-8e13-b32df46445a5",
                                "text": "Прощайте, прощайте, мои сердечные, теперь долго, долго я не увижусь с Вами даже в письме."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9279183-5218-4304-9914-e34f977646ef",
                                "sense_id": "dbe1133d-dcdf-38eb-8e13-b32df46445a5",
                                "text": "Прощайте, мои ребятишки! Исчезает ваш плохой, но добрый Михаил Васильич!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90613daa-5a7f-41ae-be79-bb98447f2048",
                                "sense_id": "dbe1133d-dcdf-38eb-8e13-b32df46445a5",
                                "text": "― Ах так?! ― дико и затравленно озираясь, произнёс Иван, ― ну ладно же! Прощайте…― и головою вперёд он бросился в штору окна."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da52adca-969d-48a3-8b15-79caa0b29136",
                                "sense_id": "dbe1133d-dcdf-38eb-8e13-b32df46445a5",
                                "text": "На обратной стороне фотографии надпись, сделанная наспех черными чернилами: «Прощайте, мои дорогие, завтра меня расстреляют»."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b332e135-80e0-36bd-be6e-97081fa69f0f",
                        "entry_id": "db21c701-8ee2-3f87-9939-b63ab2081d71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предик. употребляется при выражении утраты, лишения, исчезновения чего-либо; соответствует по значению словам: больше нет, не будет, исчез"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1181fc0-c128-407a-9c19-09e9bb9f861e",
                                "sense_id": "b332e135-80e0-36bd-be6e-97081fa69f0f",
                                "text": "А теперь что? Теперь всё, прощайте копейки. Меня, голубушка, миллионы ждут, и мне судимость ну никак не нужна…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07fc101b-9469-49d3-83ac-7c2cf40b0610",
                        "source_entry_id": "db21c701-8ee2-3f87-9939-b63ab2081d71",
                        "target_lang_word": "farewell",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "farewell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1fd02ac-d404-38d8-b1cc-6292e652ea43",
                                        "entry_id": "6f7ace3e-10a1-3fa2-a312-3046e1a1b01b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wish of happiness or safety at parting, especially a permanent departure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3c70001-f74f-41f1-ae52-9d434765d48f",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fd02ac-d404-38d8-b1cc-6292e652ea43",
                                                "text": "He bid farewell to all of his fans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa1d010b-a619-499f-a622-bdea08227af0",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fd02ac-d404-38d8-b1cc-6292e652ea43",
                                                "text": "The departure was not unduly prolonged.[…]Within the door Mrs. Spoker hastily imparted to Mrs. Love a few final sentiments on the subject of Divine Intention in the disposition of buckets; farewells and last commiserations; a deep, guttural instigation to the horse; and the wheels of the waggonette crunched heavily away into obscurity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d7df721-62e8-42d2-ab8e-ce54daed49d0",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fd02ac-d404-38d8-b1cc-6292e652ea43",
                                                "text": "The last train—a three-coach A.E.C. unit—from Belfast to Crumlin and back, was bade farewell with fog signals as it carried a capacity crowd of last-trip travellers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b95f144-e627-3bdb-82a3-0ca006b80d75",
                                        "entry_id": "6f7ace3e-10a1-3fa2-a312-3046e1a1b01b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A departure; the act of leaving."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "235b1413-28dd-4d23-a9d8-7f0d0a766894",
                                                "sense_id": "9b95f144-e627-3bdb-82a3-0ca006b80d75",
                                                "text": "See how the morning opes her golden gates, And takes her farewell of the glorious sun."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "326095c3-72fb-4809-9279-b56d270c7a8f",
                                                "sense_id": "9b95f144-e627-3bdb-82a3-0ca006b80d75",
                                                "text": "Before I take my farewell of the subject."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "farewell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "760a5a01-2588-38d5-ab21-3947e75a2d02",
                                        "entry_id": "259822d7-b15b-357a-b7b7-04b601ee2c00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Parting, valedictory, final."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80121c96-d11c-4d71-b82d-d7445adaa70f",
                                                "sense_id": "760a5a01-2588-38d5-ab21-3947e75a2d02",
                                                "text": "a farewell discourse;  the band's farewell tour"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "def7eac8-9adb-4837-afe5-343967ab2390",
                                                "sense_id": "760a5a01-2588-38d5-ab21-3947e75a2d02",
                                                "text": "“I'm through with all pawn-games,” I laughed. “Come, let us have a game of lansquenet. Either I will take a farewell fall out of you or you will have your sevenfold revenge”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d16cef3-a755-4aef-b45d-8ca05a470761",
                                                "sense_id": "760a5a01-2588-38d5-ab21-3947e75a2d02",
                                                "text": "But with the first gray light of dawn he arose; and before drawing the white sheet veilingly over, he took a last farewell look at that angel face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "farewell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "871dba8c-d915-3a65-bda6-b09de88bc12d",
                                        "entry_id": "de2bf4af-4aba-3f4a-b253-6342eab8e163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Goodbye; vale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a173c2c0-d3f8-450b-bad7-e139b68fb90b",
                                                "sense_id": "871dba8c-d915-3a65-bda6-b09de88bc12d",
                                                "text": "He said \"Farewell!\" and left."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e051413f-9000-4688-93c7-3743d4438642",
                                                "sense_id": "871dba8c-d915-3a65-bda6-b09de88bc12d",
                                                "text": "So farewell hope, and with hope, farewell fear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16007e7b-55ad-4690-9b95-bd6970d8b5ef",
                                                "sense_id": "871dba8c-d915-3a65-bda6-b09de88bc12d",
                                                "text": "Fareweel, my rhyme-compoſing billie!\nYour native ſoil was right ill-willie;\nBut may ye flouriſh like a lily,\nNow bonilie!\nI'll toaſt ye in my hindmoſt gillie,\nTho' owre the Sea!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "farewell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2db8ae58-b1c1-353d-aa14-e860314ea5e3",
                                        "entry_id": "d475bd6e-a651-33fc-9a76-214f8338dd77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bid farewell or say goodbye."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baec52e1-8bba-4778-99bd-4d879cb7484d",
                                                "sense_id": "2db8ae58-b1c1-353d-aa14-e860314ea5e3",
                                                "text": "He farewelled viewers with a warm sign-off after each bulletin: \"May your news be good news, and goodnight.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
